message: "If you use or adapt this framework, please cite it as below."
title: "OIOF — Operational Incident Orchestration Framework (Demo)"
abstract: >
  A reference implementation and design experiment demonstrating how a
  large language model can turn fragmented incident evidence into
  structured, auditable, human-governed decision support. All data,
  systems, people, incidents, and communications in this repository are
  synthetic.
